From a97778eaeff5481404266dc8c2e103880c9b08bb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 09:17:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(admin): audit fixes, sticky super-admin plan override,
 private support notes, paging, analytics

- Plan changes are super admin only and stick: stored in server-only planOverrides/{wid}; Paddle webhook, enforceBilling and trialLifecycle skip overridden workspaces until cleared (adminClearPlanOverride)
- Internal support notes stay on supportTickets only; customer copy gets status and optional reply. submitFeedback no longer writes internalNotes to the customer copy
- Change + audit entry commit in one batch; role changes audit before and after (fail closed)
- AI settings need manage_ai (super admin); default model updated
- Cursor paging, status filters, batched owner lookup, failed-mail view, adminAnalytics, audited adminFeedbackDetail; overview no longer audit-logged
- Indexes for supportTickets, recommendations (workspace scope), imports; explicit deny rules for planOverrides and supportTickets
- Admin UI: role-aware tabs, MFA warning banner, two-step confirm, keyboard-accessible tables, Analytics tab, override banner
- scripts/scrub-admin-data.mjs: one-time cleanup of old internalNotes and planOverride fields
- config/ai stays readable as decided (documented in rules)
